Error [jet.ReservedDunderName]: `__authority_to_wire` is reserved for Jet
  --> tests/ui/plugin_authority_wire_private.jet:8:18
    |
  8 |     print(plugin.__authority_to_wire(policy))
    |                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Double-underscore names belong to the compiler, generated binders, debugger, serializer, and tools
 Fix: Rename it without the second leading underscore
